      "text": "MAC Address is like physical address of that device and\nIP is like a virtual address of that device",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MAC Address is like physical address of that device and\nIP is like a virtual address of that device",
