    {
      "id": "8xEbjVZaihnCiKtmW4nnf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1277.2726389373959,
      "y": 4267.307150020213,
      "width": 2107.37841796875,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eebefa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cH0P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 837043266,
      "version": 675,
      "versionNonce": 1936297974,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784886875731,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ab maanlo humne TTL=3 set kiya to router(30.0.0.1) usko TTL=0 kar dega aur drop kardega and TTL Exceeded ka error reply akr dega right?\nbut somehow us or ICMP blocked tha to wo usko drop to kar dega but TTL Exceeded ka error reply nhi karega so \nsource ko pata hi hi chlega \nso that's why \n\n\"3rd hop -> * * * \"\n\nin simple word traceroute ko pata nhi us router ka IP kya hai kyuki us router ne reply hi nhi kiya tha due to some reason ( wo forward to kar rha hai req but wo reply nhi kar rha so this is the info behinnd the * * *.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ab maanlo humne TTL=3 set kiya to router(30.0.0.1) usko TTL=0 kar dega aur drop kardega and TTL Exceeded ka error reply akr dega right?\nbut somehow us or ICMP blocked tha to wo usko drop to kar dega but TTL Exceeded ka error reply nhi karega so \nsource ko pata hi hi chlega \nso that's why \n\n\"3rd hop -> * * * \"\n\nin simple word traceroute ko pata nhi us router ka IP kya hai kyuki us router ne reply hi nhi kiya tha due to some reason ( wo forward to kar rha hai req but wo reply nhi kar rha so this is the info behinnd the * * *.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BrTnIEce7e1UoBtDWNUWC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1276.8527640642162,
      "y": 4482.243816215169,
      "width": 1596.558837890625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#eebefa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cH0Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1651598210,
      "version": 270,
      "versionNonce": 2108691050,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784886875731,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Apart from ICMP being blocked or disabeld, routers may also NOT send an ICMP TTL, Exceeded reply due to rate limiting, congestion, packet loss, or timeout etc,",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Apart from ICMP being blocked or disabeld, routers may also NOT send an ICMP TTL, Exceeded reply due to rate limiting, congestion, packet loss, or timeout etc,",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
